          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "d4e90086",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#999;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:24px;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE — e.g. 1 June 2026]</strong></p>\n<p>At Burans Valley, we stand behind every jar we dispatch. Because ghee is a food product, our return window is limited — but if something is wrong, we will make it right.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">1. What We Accept for Return / Replacement</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1B3B2B;color:#fff;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Situation</th><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Resolution</th><th style=\"padding:10px 14px;text-align:left;\">Time Limit</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Physically damaged (broken seal, cracked jar)</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Full replacement or refund</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\"><strong>48 hours</strong></td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F2F5F2;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Wrong product received</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Full replacement + free pickup</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\"><strong>48 hours</strong></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Quality concern (off smell, texture)</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Case-by-case; replacement where verified</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\"><strong>48 hours</strong></td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;margin-top:36px;\">2. What We Cannot Accept</h2>\n<ul><li>Opened or partially used products (food-safety reasons), unless a genuine quality defect.</li><li>Returns initiated more than 48 hours after delivery.</li><li>Change-of-mind returns.</li><li>Damage caused by improper storage after delivery.</li></ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">3. How to Raise a Request</h2>\n<ol><li>Contact us at <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or WhatsApp <strong>[WHATSAPP]</strong> within 48 hours of delivery.</li><li>Share your <strong>Order ID</strong> and <strong>clear photographs</strong> of the damaged or incorrect item and packaging.</li><li>We respond within <strong>24 business hours</strong>.</li><li>Eligible returns: we arrange free reverse pickup or confirm disposal instructions.</li></ol>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">4. Refund Process</h2>\n<ul><li>Approved refunds go to your original payment method within <strong>5–7 business days</strong>.</li><li>COD orders: refunds via bank transfer — provide account details with your request.</li></ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">5. Cancellations</h2>\n<ul><li>Cancel <strong>before dispatch</strong> by emailing <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> with your Order ID.</li><li>Once dispatched, raise a return request after delivery.</li><li>We may cancel orders for stock issues, payment failure, or fraud — full refund provided.</li></ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">6. Questions?</h2>\n<p>Email <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or see our <a href=\"/grievance-redressal\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Grievance Redressal page</a>.</p>\n",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
